          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. Anil claims to his friend Sanvi that respiration and breathing are the same process. What question(s) can Sanvi ask him to make him understand that he is not correct?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
