            0.697,
            0.689,
            0.779
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. Which of the following statements is correct and why? Anu: We inhale air. Shanu: We inhale oxygen. Tanu: We inhale air rich in oxygen."
